 "description": "ReviewMachine conformance. Each step feeds one event (`do`) at media time `time`, playback `rate` and wall clock `now`; `effects` (when given) are the exact effects, `state` (when given) is the state afterwards: paused | playing | recording. Numbers in effects are printed without trailing zeros. Run by both cores.",
